## special customer dialogues below!!
# tutorial
~ intro_dialogue
Anya!! I didn't know you'd be at the festival!
How's Moka doing now?
He was so wild as a kitten...
I heard about your debt!
do set_expression(Customer.CustomerExpression.DISSATISFIED)
Poor Moka was so sick...
do set_expression(Customer.CustomerExpression.NEUTRAL)
...What's that?
Today's your last shot at paying it off?

Well then, you better be quick with orders...
You don't want customers leaving!
=> END 

~ took_too_long
You took too long! But I don't mind...
=> END

