How about a black coffee?
=> END 

~ order_tutorial_hot_chocolate
Hot chocolate this time!
=> END 

~ tutorial_correct_order
Wonderful!
=> END

~ tutorial_incorrect_order
Come on, you can do better than that!
=> END

~ tutorial_cat_warning_1
Watch out for Moka! 
He's running around at the back!
=> END

~ tutorial_cat_warning_2
